@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M17 — Gated isolated restoration and demonstrated usable state
state "Recovery prerequisites\nmissing" as Blocked
state "Defined isolated drill\neligible" as Ready
state "Isolated restore underway" as Restoring
state "Integrity/access/effects\nunder assessment" as Checking
state "Scoped usable recovery\ndemonstrated" as Demonstrated
state "Failed / incomplete\nrecovery evidence" as Incomplete
state "Actual restoration result\nunknown" as Unknown
[*] --> Blocked : scoped initial context
Blocked --> Ready : SM-T110 prerequisites verified\n[actual prerequisites present]
Ready --> Restoring : SM-T111 drill starts\n[authorized isolated drill]
Restoring --> Checking : SM-T112 restore result observed\n[actual restored candidate]
Restoring --> Incomplete : SM-T113 known restore failure\n[definite failure evidence]
Restoring --> Unknown : SM-T114 result unconfirmed\n[actual result unresolved]
Checking --> Demonstrated : SM-T115 criteria satisfied\n[actual scoped criteria met]
Checking --> Incomplete : SM-T116 criteria not satisfied\n[unmet / insufficient criteria]
Unknown --> Checking : SM-T117 restore reconciled\n[restored candidate verified]
Unknown --> Incomplete : SM-T118 failure reconciled\n[definite disposition]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
